'''''Pseudocrossidium''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Pottiaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Pseudocrossidium R.S.Williams |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2671800 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=22 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref> It has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

